<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Notes body"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="685800" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="5486400" cy="7315200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" rIns="0" tIns="0" bIns="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">Actual provisional selection is implemented by deterministic bipartite matching over seeded candidate orderings, not ad hoc manual outcome selection. Each duplicate/template component has capacity one across all 20 bags; generic/large groups flagged for manual review are excluded. Per domain, each bag has 10 attack inputs, one explicit-retention benign and five suggestive benign inputs. The protocol’s future Z-controlled design instead requires eight independently unsafe attack bundles, two independently safe attack bundles and six independently safe benign bundles per domain. These happen to preserve the same case totals but are scientifically different. Current provisional groups control Y_case placement and cannot establish a true unsafe-memory rate. D00–D07 are development, not an untouched confirmatory set. D08–D19 are prepared but were not used for this comparison.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve"></a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">SOURCES</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- src/ams/research/provisional/episodes.py</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- reports/MPBENCH_DYNAMIC_EXPERIMENT_PROTOCOL.md §4</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31